      "message": "[error] Line 1896: 🔴 Filtering the local interface address with isRoutable() risks dropping valid SRFLX candidates for the common NAT case where the local base address is RFC1918/ULA and only the published address is globally reachable. The local address only needs to be usable for binding on the selected interface; keep the routability filter on the published address and only reject local addresses that are unspecified/loopback/link-local if that is the intended constraint.",
