      "side": 1,
      "message": "[error] Line 1067: 🔴 This rejects the entire SRFLX candidate set when any local address is not routable. If isRoutable() excludes private IPv4 or IPv6 ULA, this breaks server-reflexive candidates behind NAT, where the local/base address is normally private and the public address is the routable one. Validate routability on publicAddr only, or use a narrower local-address predicate that excludes only unspecified/loopback/link-local.",
